## Verified Acceptance Modules

1. **School Profile & Branding**: Real ABC School metadata, logo, cover image, and contact info loaded dynamically from MongoDB.
2. **Alumni Data Roster Import**: 476 alumni imported across Class of 2005–2025 with duplicate matching & error CSV export.
3. **Onboarding & Auto-Matching**: Mobile registration queries CSV roster and auto-approves matching alumni.
4. **OTP & Verification Queue**: 60s resend cooldown, pin lock, side-by-side roster review, single-click approval.
5. **Batch & Coordinator Security Scope**: Batch management (2005–2025); 2010 Coordinator isolated from 2011 (403 Forbidden).
6. **Get-Together Event Publishing**: 2010 Silver Jubilee Reunion at Taj Connemara (Max Capacity: 300).
7. **RSVP & Guest Steppers**: Adult & child guest count steppers; capacity calculation blocks overbooking (409 Conflict).
8. **Cryptographic QR Entry Tickets**: Signed JWT ticket token without exposing personal information.
9. **Venue Scanner Terminal & Manual Fallback**: Instant green success screen, red duplicate alert screen, manual search fallback.
10. **Photo Memories & Azure Blob Storage**: PIL WebP compression (1600px main, 400px thumbnail) and admin moderation.
11. **Attendance CSV Export**: Spreadsheet streaming with exact check-in timestamps and scanner IDs.
12. **Data Persistence Across Restarts**: MongoDB persistence verified across backend restarts and browser reloads.

